\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3-Ukraine backs away from  \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia \highlight\uc2  rise,wants euro peg  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Natalya Zinets  \par \uc2 672 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 August 2005\par 11:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds new \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealer quote)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, Aug 30 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Economy Ministry appeared on Tuesday to abandon a campaign for a strong rise in the value of the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had resisted, and proposed pegging the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the euro from 2007.  \par \par \uc2 The Economy Ministry said it now intended to use a rate of 5.05 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the dollar in its forecasting for next year, weaker than the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate.  \par \par \uc2 The ministry also proposed the euro peg, a new development in a debate about whether the ex-Soviet state should target a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  rather than just focus on the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 Economy Minister Serhiy Teryokhin, one of the strongest advocates of a more flexible \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange rate, has repeatedly urged the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to allow the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to rise as this would help the fight against inflation.  \par \par \uc2 But the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has resisted the pressure in a policy aimed at protecting the interests of exporters which provide the engine of economic growth. It has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost daily to prevent any rapid climb in the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  since it engineered a three percent jump at a single stroke last April.  \par \par \uc2 A bank official said last week the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was optimal. On Tuesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars at 5.01 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  compared with the rate of 5.0 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the dollar used in the past seven sessions.  \par \par \uc2 "The volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  is low and many orders are still not covered," a dealer said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had previously set the volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at $10 million.  \par \par \uc2 The ministry statement appeared to indicate an agreement of sorts between the two sides. It said the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate depended on factors including the trade balance, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regulations and the state of Ukraine's financial institutions.  \par \par \uc2 "It is for this reason that the Economy Ministry has worked out and tactically agreed on an average rate of 5.05 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  per dollar in its 2006 macroeconomic forecasts," it said.  \par \par \uc2 "This takes into account that from 2007 the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be pegged to the euro in accordance with the rules set down by the European Union." It gave no other details but the government has said that it wants the country to move closer to the EU before eventually joining the bloc.  \par \par \uc2 BASKET OF \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2 ?  \par \par \uc2 The Economy Ministry launched a debate earlier this year on whether Ukraine should change its policy by ending a rigid peg to the dollar and start targeting a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Teryokhin has also called on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to raise the proportion of euros in its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said changes would depend on the structure of Ukraine's debt and trading obligations. Bank officials were not immediately available for comment on the ministry's statement.  \par \par \uc2 "Given the foreign trade structure of Ukraine and increasing Russian moves towards a EUR/USD RUB (euro/dollar rouble) basket, a Ukrainian move closer to EUR makes some sense, though a 100 percent EUR target would be extreme given the USD-linked nature of their exports," Bank Austria Creditanstalt said in a note.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has failed so far to follow through on pledges to liberalise strict rules for market participants despite appeals from President Viktor Yushchenko, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers and the International Monetary Fund.  \par \par \uc2 Analysts said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had missed a chance to proceed with \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market liberalisation, given a recent spate of bad economic figures underscoring slowing growth and a worsening trade balance.  \par \par \uc2 "In the current situation, it is stupid to implement liberalisation. It is unclear what is going on. Macroeconomic data are bad, there are no signs of serious investments," said Glib Vishlynsky, senior analyst at GFk-USM.  \par \par \uc2 "Nobody needs \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  volatility. Liberalisation will be delayed and the rate will be held stable."  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-UKRAINE-RATE (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|BNX|RNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050830e18u000q7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
