\par\par \b \uc2 RPT-UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia \highlight\uc2  rate unchanged  \b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 August 2005\par 15:15\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Removes word "CORRECTED" from headline)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, Aug 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market it controls closely, buying dollars at 5.0 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the sixth consecutive session.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said dollar supply outpaced demand as it has for the past two months. They said interbank deals were being clinched during the day at 4.95-4.97.  \par \par \uc2 "Dollar supply is pretty significant," said one dealer. "But demand was a bit stronger than what we had seen in recent days."  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been committed to a policy of preventing any sharp upward movement of the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to protect the interests of exporters -- the engine of economic growth.  \par \par \uc2 The bank's first deputy chairman, Anatoly Shapovalov, said on Thursday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate for the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was "optimal". He also predicted demand for dollars would rise in the autumn as cold weather prompted purchases of energy.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the first time this week on Friday departed from the practice it introduced last week of issuing parameters for possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in advance of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 But dealers said they had expected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  regardless. And they said the amounts of dollars purchased were relatively small -- and generally confined to exporters' earnings.  \par \par \uc2 Little change was expected next week in terms of dollar supply exceeding demand.  \par \par \uc2 Some dealers say attempts to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  within limits would run up against a probable influx of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in response to plans to stage new privatisations of industrial sites.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has failed to follow through on pledges to liberalise market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  despite appeals from President Viktor Yushchenko, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers and the International Monetary Fund.  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050826e18q001bn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
