\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  C.Bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia \highlight\uc2  rate unchanged  \b0\par\par\uc2 293 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 August 2005\par 14:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds details, background)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, Aug 22 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the tightly-controlled \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Monday, buying dollars at 5.0 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the same rate as at the last session.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  throughout last week to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  steady in what dealers say amounts to an assurance that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not be allowed to rise sharply.  \par \par \uc2 It bought dollars at 5.0 on Thursday and Friday last week -- a slight weakening of the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  after earlier \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 4.99 and 4.98.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers say an excess supply of dollars is expected to persist throughout this week.  \par \par \uc2 The bank launched the trading day with its now standard practice of setting parameters for possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 5.0/5.6 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  per dollar and set the indicative volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at $40 million.  \par \par \uc2 Interbank deals were being struck from the opening at 4.9800/5.0000.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers have complained about a lack of predictability of rates. Many said the bank's failure to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  quickly earlier in the month pushed the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  sharply higher for a time, sowing panic among exporters, the engine behind economic growth.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers, ministers and the International Monetary Fund have called for a liberalisation of the trading rules.  \par \par \uc2 Ukrainian President Viktor Yushchenko has told \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Viktor Stelmakh to draft proposals to alter the rules.  \par \par \uc2 But there has so far been no indication of any quick change to rules -- among them a bar on buying and selling \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the same day -- despite the resignation last week of a top bank official who opposed liberalisation.  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050822e18m00104\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
