c2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has so far rejected all calls for \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market liberalisation, saying Ukraine's financial stability was still fragile.  \par \par \uc2 It bought $397.3 million on the interbank market in July after selling $10.5 million in June.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050804e184001cp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
