the deals were done between 5.010 and 5.015 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday. They also said the trend of higher dollar supply would change in the near term due to lower exporters' revenues and traditionally quieter summer business activity.  \par \par \uc2 Ukrainian exporters have been suffering from deteriorating world market conditions for their major products -- steel and chemicals.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  acts as a clearing house for the interbank market because commercial banks are not allowed to both sell and buy \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a single trading day.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|MD|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050715e17f001f2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
