rly since, both buying and selling dollars, to defend its new target rate of 5.05 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 It has been buying dollars at a rate of 5.01 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the end of April.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|BNX  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050714e17e001d1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
