\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Ukraine's  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  buys dollars for fourth day  \b0\par\par\uc2 322 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Juli 2005\par 14:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds details, comment by economy minister)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, July 13 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's tightly-controlled \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Wednesday, buying dollars at 5.01 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  for a fourth day in a row, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 "Dollar supply has increased on the market now. Today we saw several very large banks selling dollars. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to come out," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 "We will see more \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week. The market is unbalanced. There are more dollars at the moment."  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  acts as a clearing house for the interbank market because commercial banks are not allowed to both sell and buy \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a single trading day.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  allowed the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  <UAH=> to raise by 3 percent in a single day in April and has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly since, both buying and selling dollars, to defend its new target rate of 5.05 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The International Monetary Fund and government officials have repeatedly urged the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to allow greater exchange rate flexibility.  \par \par \uc2 Economy Minister Serhiy Teryokhin reiterated his stand on Wednesday, saying the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should free up the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 Teryokhin gave a wish list to reporters: "Change the basket for the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Set a corridor for rate fluctuations. Do not fix the rate as it is being fixed by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the moment. Do not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  at every fluctuation by 0.01 of the copeck as they are doing now."  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixes the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  with administrative means. The official \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate of 5.05 to the dollar has been unchanged since April.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  promised to free up the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in May but has so far delayed the necessary decisions. It argues that \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's financial stability is still fragile.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050713e17d0019u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
