\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Ukraine's  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  resumes dollar purchases  \b0\par\par\uc2 228 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Juli 2005\par 15:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds quotes)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, July 8 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday, buying dollars at 5.01 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the second time this week, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which tightly controls the market, raised the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  <UAH=> by 3 percent in a single day in April and has since regularly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , both buying and selling dollars, to defend its new target rate of 5.05 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "Today it was clear from the morning that dollar supply was much higher. The rate was at about 5.01 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  immediately from the start and it was about the same in late trade," said one dealer.  \par \par \uc2 They said demand for dollars was lower this month compared with June, characteristic of the summer lull.  \par \par \uc2 "Nothing interesting is happening in summer. Everything has calmed down with fuel supplies until the harvest," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 In June, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  both sold and bought dollars on the interbank market, its transactions in the end amounting to sales of $10.5 million to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In May, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $387.1 million on the market.  \par \par \uc2 Demand for dollars in June and May was driven by the need to import more fuel to help complete sowing.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050708e178001a7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
