\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  c.bank buys dollars in  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 243 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Juni 2005\par 16:25\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds details, quotes)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, June 29 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market it tightly controls, buying dollars for the first time in nearly three weeks at 5.01 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said,.  \par \par \uc2 The bank last bought dollars on June 10 in its efforts to maintain the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  within rigid limits. Wednesday's trading followed a four-day holiday in Ukraine.  \par \par \uc2 "It appears a big seller was on the market today, there were plenty of buyers, but there was enough for both them and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said one dealer. "I don't think there was a great oversupply. There was no overall selling."  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said deals were being struck at the end of the day at 5.01/5.025 against 5.03/5.05 at the start.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen as undervalued early in the year and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a single day in April by about 3 percent to 5.05 per dollar.  \par \par \uc2 The trend has since changed due to slower economic growth and it has tended to sell dollars -- eight times this month at 5.06, including Thursday and Friday of last week.  \par \par \uc2 Market participatns say greater amounts of \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  tend to be needed at the end of each month for internal accounting and various payments.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|BNX  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050629e16t001gq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
