\par\par \b \uc2 Ukraine cbank plans gradual freeing up of  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  mkt.   \b0\par\par\uc2 399 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 April 2005\par 17:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 KIEV, April 9 (Reuters) - Ukraine's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is working on a plan to introduce a gradual liberalisation of the rigidly controlled \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, a first deputy \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chairman said on Saturday.   \par \par \uc2 Anatoly Shapovalov told reporters the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wants to allow commercial banks to buy and sell \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  during one trading day and may extend the trading session by one hour.   \par \par \uc2 "We certainly need to remove market regulations to allow banks buy and sell the same day. This is a chance to become more flexible. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will only appear on the market when it sees sharp volatility and then it will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said after a government meeting.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2  has one of the toughest \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regimes in the world. Commercial banks are allowed to buy or sell hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  only under clients' orders. They can also either buy or sell hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  during one trading day. The trading session lasts for about four hours.   \par \par \uc2 On Thursday, many \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers complained that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dominant market player, did not buy dollars on the interbank market and banks failed to meet their obligations to clients.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  usually acts as a main seller or buyer of the hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It also fixes the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate to the dollar administratively.   \par \par \uc2 Ukraine's new liberal government, which rose to power on the back of the Orange Revolution, has repeatedly called on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to free up the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and allow the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to float more freely.   \par \par \uc2 The restrictions were introduced in 1998 to battle consequences of a Russian financial crisis. \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers and Western economists said the measures are now unnecessary given Ukraine's steady economic growth and a record current account surplus.   \par \par \uc2 One of the first steps in freeing up the market was a decision by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the government to scrap a rule demanding exporters sell at least 50 percent of their hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  earnings on the interbank market.   \par \par \uc2 The rule was eliminated from April 1.   \par \par \uc2 Shapovalov said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had set up a special working group which was working on how to change the software the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was using for the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.   \par \par \uc2 "Certainly, we need to give banks certain time to adjust," Shapovalov said. "But I think we will propose the changes in May."    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050409e14900af2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
