\par\par \b \uc2  Ukraine Bank Faces Hard  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Choice As Polls Loom \b0\par\par\uc2 715 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juli 1999\par 16:18\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MOSCOW (Dow Jones)--Pressure on Ukraine's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UAH) has put the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a quandary just three months before the Oct. 31 presidential election. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , down more than 7% against the dollar in recent weeks, is in peril of crashing out of its existing exchange-rate corridor, adding fuel to inflation during the sensitive run-up to the polls. \par \par \uc2  "Of course (the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) will continue to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bank spokeswoman Lydia Mykhailova. The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  "without a doubt" will remain within its current trading corridor of UAH3.9-UAH4.6, she said. \par \par \uc2  While offering support to its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, the National Bank of Ukraine must ration its gold and foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to keep the country on track with the International Monetary Fund. \par \par \uc2  The timing and extent of the support will be crucial, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  began to plummet two weeks ago as Russia's gasoline shortage spread to its western neighbor. Ukrainian gasoline prices jumped by 100%, undermining the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the process. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has fallen steeply, closing at UAH4.47-UAH4.55 in interbank trading Friday, more than 15% weaker than UAH3.92 on July 16. The dollar was quoted around UAH4.15-UAH4.50 in street kiosks, compared with UAH4.06 two weeks earlier. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was slightly overvalued when it was at UAH3.94; that is why the National Bank of Ukraine was satisfied when it devalued to UAH4.10-UAH4.15," said an executive with a western bank in Kiev. "The pace of devaluation has decreased in the last few days but the pressure is enormous." \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                        IMF Rules\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The National Bank also finds itself constrained by the terms of an\par International Monetary Fund lending program that requires it to keep\par reserves over $1 billion, limiting scope for \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The margin isn't big. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ukraine\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's reserves rose by $100 million during\par the first half of July to $1.29 billion, the National Bank of Ukraine\par said on July 22.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par By comparison, the government has $11.6 billion in outstanding foreign\par debts, said Ivan Kompan, head of research at Wood & Co. brokerage in\par Kiev, including $3 billion maturing next year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par With wage arrears at UAH7.1 billion, further depreciation of the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is to the government's advantage, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par And there are questions about the efficacy of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  support for\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 hryvnia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . People often stash their savings, whether in dollars or\par local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , elsewhere than in the banking system.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The banks therefore cannot be sure when money is being spirited away\par in panic and possibly changed into hard \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , since it occurs on\par the black market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "A lot of money is in cash and people keep their money under the\par mattresses, not in the banks," Kompan said. "It's difficult to say\par whether \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will help or not."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par With the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 hryvnia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  fluctuating so widely, the bank will have be shrewd\par about picking its moment if it does decide to prop up the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par If the bank chooses to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at UAH4.40-UAH4.50, just below the\par ceiling of its trading corridor, investors are likely to call its bluff,\par the western bank executive said. By contrast, if it enters the market at\par the UAH4.20-UAH4.30, that would be taken as a sign for the market to\par stabilize, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  should be able to keep the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 hryvnia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  within its\par corridor until the elections, the executive said. Ukrainian exporters\par are obliged to sell 50% of their hard \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  proceeds on local\par exchanges, he noted. With the harvest season approaching, local\par exchanges will see an influx of foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  from the country's\par largest export, sugar, helping to relieve some of the pressure on the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 hryvnia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par With gasoline prices likely to ease in the next few days, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 hryvnia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par is being largely influenced by "psychological factors," Mykhailova said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Sergei Yaramenko, the head of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par department, said Friday that the bank is permanently monitoring the\par foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market to assess the need for \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the\par Interfax news agency reported.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Andrea Chipman; 7095-974-8055; achipman@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 30-07-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1418GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1194 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv7u05scn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
