\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk May  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Mkt-Interfax \b0\par\par\uc2 184 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juli 1999\par 11:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MOSCOW (Dow Jones)--The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't rule out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the country's interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the Interfax news agency reported Friday, quoting a senior bank official. \par \par \uc2  Ukraine's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UAH), has fallen steeply over the last two weeks. Early Friday, the dollar was officially offered at UAH4.21, more than 7% higher than UAH3.92 on July 16. The dollar was quoted around UAH4.25 in street kiosks, around 4.7% higher than UAH4.06 two weeks earlier. \par \par \uc2  The bank is permanently monitoring the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to assess the need for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said the head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  department, Sergei Yaramenko. \par \par \uc2  Referring to the rapid depreciation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Yaramenko said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  "is working to prevent the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  from falling," and he added that the Ukrainian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would soon "be brought in order." \par \par \uc2  He said the National Bank might use stricter regulation in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, but he didn't elaborate. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 30-07-99 \par \par \uc2  0917GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv7u05rju\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
