\par\par \b \uc2  INTERVIEW- \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  c.bank mulls  \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Natalia Zinets \par \uc2 559 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Juli 1999\par 15:06\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  KIEV, July 29 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the weakened \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  but will not use administrative controls to limit dollar demand, a top \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "I will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but when I will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  I have not decided yet - I mean the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," the head of the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  department Serhiy Yaremenko told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  "I mean that for now there will be no administrative restrictions...the necessity of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is being discussed," Yaremenko said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has slipped by several kopecks in the past 10 days, sparking fears of a heavier fall among some traders and their clients after months of relative stability. \par \par \uc2  The official \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange rate based on interbank trades of the previous two days eased to 4.1790 to the dollar on Thursday from 4.1569 on Wednesday and 3.9487 early last week. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said dollar bid/offer quotes had fallen to 4.55/4.60 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  just before Yeremenko's comments from 4.33/4.37 at the open of interbank trade. There were hardly any deals. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is necessary, some kind of step in the right direction," said one dealer. \par \par \uc2  Dealers blamed last week's fuel crisis, which doubled the price of petrol over a week and exacerbated problems with the harvest, for sparking the first weakness in the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the retail market, which spilled into the interbank market. \par \par \uc2  Some traders on Wednesday, noting increased dollar demand and no offers, said the market expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to fall further in closer proportion to the rise in fuel prices. They said psychological factors were also pushing the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower. \par \par \uc2  Yaremenko said increased demand for dollars was coming from major fuel traders making large imports to replenish supplies. \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  head Viktor Yushchenko said this week that fuel accounted for about 40 percent of imports. \par \par \uc2  "It is not that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is destabilised but that there is higher demand for hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is connected with the need to purchase fuel," said Yaremenko. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the bank needed to spend more now to balance the market than it would have done had it acted earlier. \par \par \uc2  "If the Bank had got involved back then, it would have been selling along with other big banks. But this way everyone's sitting on dollars," another trader said. \par \par \uc2  Yaremenko declined to say when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was going to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  or in what volumes but said the bank's board did not regard the situation as critical. \par \par \uc2  "I'm not saying that we're sleeping soundly but the bank's board does not see a critical situation for now," he said. Yushchenko said on Wednesday a fall in the the official rate of 4.3 percent in the last week was not a major move when compared to the rise in the price of fuel. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  trades within a band of between 3.4-4.6 to the dollar, set by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and government in agreement with the IMF until the end of the year. Yushchenko said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be able to support the band to the end of the year. (( Kiev Newsroom, +380 44 244 9150, e-mail:kiev.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv7t03fut\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
