\par\par \b \uc2  ANALYSIS-Ukraine c.bank in tough spot over ING bond. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Christina Ling \par \uc2 564 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 1999\par 12:08\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  KIEV, June 18 (Reuters) - Ukraine has created a dilemma for its \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  by its restructuring proposal for an overdue $155 million ING Barings bond, analysts said on Friday, as a June 23 deadline for a deal edges ever nearer. \par \par \uc2  The Finance Ministry made an offer to investors in May to redeem 20 percent of the bond, which matured on June 9, and restructure the rest into three-year Eurobonds. \par \par \uc2  Some investors are insisting on 100 percent redemption, and the ministry says talks are continuing into the "remedy" period of 10 working days by the end of which the government must pay, reach agreement with investors or effectively default. \par \par \uc2  Analysts say default is unlikely. Top officials have also ruled out the possibility. \par \par \uc2  But the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said earlier this week redemption of 20 percent of the bond in cash would lead to serious difficulties in fulfilling promises to the IMF under Ukraine's $2.6 billion loan agreement. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it was concerned for its foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, which the finance ministry would tap to buy dollars to pay ING. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  head Viktor Yushchenko said this week gross foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, which the bank has been building to meet IMF targets, had risen to $1.28 billion from $1.18 billion last week. But the bank said it was still not in the clear. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried out by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market with the goal of replenishing international \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves for now does not permit confirmation that the problem of achieving the necessary volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves is already solved," the bank's statement on the bond said. \par \par \uc2  Analysts differed over whether Ukraine's reserves allowed payment of $163 million, the ING bond's principal plus interest due. \par \par \uc2  But payment would in general endanger macroeconomic targets agreed with the IMF, said Ivan Kompan, Wood & Co. investment bank's research head, adding talks were likely to continue to the eleventh hour. \par \par \uc2  "Technically paying the loan is possible, the bank has enough reserves, but it would lead to non-compliance with IMF requirements and therefore IMF financing could be stopped," Kompan said. \par \par \uc2  "Ukraine would lose its only feasible source of financing. I don't believe Ukraine can afford to do that, on the other hand it has to pay its debts. They have to find some compromise." \par \par \uc2  Analysts said that in particular the finance ministry would have to sell new treasury bills to redeem any part of the bond. \par \par \uc2  That would effectively mean selling to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has been the sole purchaser at primary auctions since commercial banks were scared off by the cash-strapped ministry's efforts to restructure their treasury bills portfolios. \par \par \uc2  But one analyst said the economic plan agreed with the IMF precluded further primary sales of treasury bills this month. \par \par \uc2  And Olexander Bazarov, head of Credit Suisse First Boston Ukraine said a new \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  regulatory law banned the bank from crediting the ministry at all. \par \par \uc2  "If the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  makes an emission - because if it gives the ministry \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  that is essentially making an emission - then the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could fall outside the parameters approved by the IMF," he said. ((Kiev newsroom, +380 44 244 9150 email:kiev.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv6i0688i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
