\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  says  \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia intervention \highlight\uc2  only tactical. \b0\par\par\uc2 154 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Oktober 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  KIEV, Oct 30 (Reuter) - The chief of \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday confirmed that the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has been slipping in recent weeks, will be left free to find its own level without heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the bank. \par \par \uc2  "The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2  will use tactical \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the money market, regardless of whatever trend the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate is demonstrating," Viktor Yushchenko told reporters. \par \par \uc2  He said the bank would not interfere in recent growth in demand for hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell to 1.81 to the dollar on the Ukraine Interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange on Wednesday from 1.80 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  stood at 1.76 to the dollar, the rate set at its September 2 debut, until October 7, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it stopped \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to maintain the level. \par \par \uc2  --Natalya Zinets, Kiev Newsroom +380 44 229 2264 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018dsau00xyn\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\c